# postable-projects.txt — the ONLY repos shippost is allowed to mine for
# "build-in-public" posts. Copy this file to engine/postable-projects.txt
# (which is gitignored) and list the absolute path to each of YOUR OWN repos,
# one per line. Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# HARD RULE: never list a client/employer repo here. shippost talks about
# YOUR craft, never who you build for. Everything is scrubbed anyway, but the
# allowlist is your first line of defense.

# ~/Desktop/Projects/my-side-project
# ~/Desktop/Projects/another-app/another-app
